  "comment": "The repository folder rule (ExtensionRepositoryFolder in Swift, repository-folder.ts in the Extension Store): a server, a port or none and the address's path segments in, the folder or the refusal out; which folders isValid accepts; and the equal and nesting checks. Every address is made up, except fudgeapp/development, Fudge's own development folder. Each refusal's one sentence is in sentences.",
